// auto-numbered sub-cases inside auto-numbered cases, with a nested opener
let x, y in Z. wts xy is odd iff x and y are both odd
case x is even
then xy = x * y is even for any y.
case x is odd
exhaustive cases
subcase y is even
then xy is even.
subcase y is odd
then x = 2a + 1 and y = 2b + 1 for some a, b in Z, so xy = 2(2ab + a + b) + 1 is odd.
in either case, xy is odd exactly when x and y are both odd
qed
